This file contains scrape rule definitions for two novel websites.
They can be imported via the admin UI or the API.

## 1. 5165.org (大悟读书网)
- Structure: WordPress-based, clean HTML
- Categories: /wangluo/, /yuanzhu/, /wenxue/, /wuxia/, /kehuan/, etc.
- Book list: <li> items in category pages
- Book detail: Schema.org Book JSON-LD metadata + .html chapter links
- Chapter content: <div class="entry-content" id="entry-{id}"> with <div data-id="N"><p>...</p></div>

## 2. 23.225.66.244 (二三阅读)
- Structure: Custom PHP novel site
- Categories: /sort/1/1.html through /sort/7/1.html
- Book list: <div class="item"> with <dl><dt>title</dt><dd>desc</dd></dl>
- Book detail: <div class="info"> with metadata, <a href="/bqg/{id}/{chapterId}.html"> for chapters
- Chapter content: Dynamic JS rendering - requires Playwright engine
- Cover: /files/article/image/{nnn}/{id}/{id}s.jpg
